# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
# Serves index.html (with 200 status) for any path that isn't a static file
# or a Pages Function. Required for HTML5 history-mode routing so deep links
# like https://turnpagedigital.com/crypto work on initial load.
#
# Cloudflare Pages applies functions in /functions/* with higher priority,
# so /api/* etc. continue to route to their handlers.

